# Upstream files the overlay-legacy flavour adds (build-overlay.sh): what our profiles resolve to that
# alsa-ucm-conf < 1.2.11 (Debian 12: 1.2.8, Ubuntu 24.04: 1.2.10) does not ship. Each path must be absent from
# those releases' own package, or the overlay would clash with it.
